---
title: "Village & Community Tour"
description: "Go beyond the tourist trail to a rural Zanzibar village, meet local families and learn about seaweed farming, crafts and daily Swahili life."
permalink: "/tours/village-community-tour/index.html"
tour_slug: "village-community-tour"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="tour-detail">
  <section class="tour-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dct-ocean) 0%, var(--dct-palm) 100%);">
    <div class="tour-hero-content">
      {% set featured = page.inputPath | featuredImage %}
{% set cdnSrc = page.inputPath | cdnImage %}
<img src="{{ cdnSrc }}" alt="{{ featured.featuredAlt or page.title }}" class="tour-hero-image" loading="lazy">

      <span class="card-badge badge-cultural">CUL — Cultural Tour</span>
      <h1>Village / community tour</h1>
      <p class="tour-meta">2–4 hours · Kizimbani, Jambiani or south-east villages</p>
      <div class="tour-price-box">
        <span class="price-label">From</span>
        <span class="price-amount">{% catPrice "village-community-tour" %}</span>
        <span class="price-note">per person</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=I%27d%20like%20to%20book%20village%20community%20tour" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Book via WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="tour-grid">
    <div class="tour-main">
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Go beyond the tourist trail to a local village in Kizimbani, Jambiani, or the southeast coast. Meet families, learn about seaweed farming, traditional crafts, and daily life in rural Zanzibar.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>2–4 hour guided village visit</li>
      <li>Seaweed farm demonstration and hands-on participation</li>
      <li>Traditional craft workshop (basket weaving, pottery)</li>
      <li>Home-cooked local lunch in a family setting</li>
      <li>Community donation included in price</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Tour Highlights in Pictures</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'woman-weaving-thread-zanzibar-village.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'woman-weaving-thread-zanzibar-village.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Artisan Weaving</span>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'woman-collecting-seaweed-zanzibar-coast.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'woman-collecting-seaweed-zanzibar-coast.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Seaweed Harvesting</span>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'child-bicycle-dirt-road-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'child-bicycle-dirt-road-zanzibar.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Village Daily Life</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Duration & Meeting Point</h2>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 2–4 hours</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Kizimbani, Jambiani, or southeast villages (pickup included from south/east coast hotels)</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Important Notes</h2>
        <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>This is a community experience — respectful dress (shoulders and knees covered) is required</li>
      <li>Donation goes directly to the village development fund</li>
      <li>Not a staged performance — real community interaction</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Inclusions</h2>
        <ul class="includes-list">
      <li>Village walk, seaweed/craft visit, local lunch</li>
      <li>donation varies</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% include "tour-reviews.njk" %}
      {% include "tour-faq.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside class="tour-sidebar">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h4>📍 Tour Details</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="label">Duration:</span><span class="value">2–4 hours</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Location:</span><span class="value">Kizimbani, Jambiani or south-east villages</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Category:</span><span class="value">{{ 'CUL' | attractionTypeLabel }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="booking-card">
          <div class="price">{% catPrice tour_slug %} <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85;">/ person</span></div>
          <h3>Ready to Book?</h3>
          <p style="opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Send us your preferred date and group size on WhatsApp. We'll confirm with a fixed price including all fees.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20{{ title | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">WhatsApp: {{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}</a>
          <p class="note">✓ Verified planning range • Marine conservation fees included • Zero booking deposit</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {% include "tour-mobile-sticky.njk" %}
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
